。那年我正安逸，顺手在笔记里写下九个字：呆得太爽，就会有问题。如今回头看，那句话比什么鸡汤都管用。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawkO3gTlibkBPXMYBo2QpdLJ7bFPADoYkHU0hpFJuVjhtTVzIo74e91OwV5XkjQibUIBzvd4SCu2bOJpdZH9FgKwibWOg6vj274tIg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-30T23:58:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488160:1","title":"PHP2Shell应急：从漏洞情报到业务影响，中间隔着什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488160&idx=1&sn=a34f4a244fb8c3fbfad4cff6623f7e0c&chksm=ea31714da2d2ed2f108e04e702f379ddf002a70a4bd18287d6f98f2acc3c0ac3101dce449722&scene=126&sessionid=1795773358#rd","description":"这次 PHP2Shell 之后，我一直在想一个问题：企业应急里最难、最稀缺的，是不是漏洞分析和复现能力？情报获取其实不难，难的是看到漏洞之后，尤其是有 POC 的高门槛漏洞，还要认真分析它对业务系统的实际影响，再决定要不要发起应急响应。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawmHNemTmxGiafTa6aop1xhcj4yJRniaxIg4No6jiayPW8wShvSWlwNOibsZ0otd9G933mhKudmynia5sBvb7Yz0CsvniaMu35nXJlkNY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-27T16:11:05.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ%3D%3D:2247488147:1","title":"我的读书笔记：把自己当成一家私人公司","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI3Njk2OTIzOQ==&mid=2247488147&idx=1&sn=1078ac7ce4b922f3f17507af4aaa9867&chksm=ea2f8f80cd2be20c289ce4950c94f6b28bf04df3c6f09a9e51f62a8dd23f644ab26bdb479b16&scene=126&sessionid=1795773358#rd","description":"都说别把公司当自己家。我倒觉得，该把自己当一家公司经营 - - 只不过公司是你最大的舞台、第一个客户，你在这儿的业绩就是你的业绩。环境不顺、薪资不够高就觉得浪费时间？那亏的是你自己这家公司。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FJFR9icl1yawniawEhDXk2bClyPd8ibGszbVtrfcozJBusNHUBp2lEbT2UpALW4370ou7icTyicMGa6cq3YqZaAscjH6EniaQh5oCguXC4iazVia9DFw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-24T15:39:01.000Z"}]}